[h1]Cosmic Chronicles[/h1]
[i]A Dynamic Narrative & Living Galaxy Expansion Mod[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]🚀 Version 2.0.0: The Galactic News Network[/h2]
This massive update fully realizes the Galactic News Network! Live, dynamic articles are pushed to a dedicated UI tab based entirely on the mathematical state of the galaxy and vanilla progression! Furthermore, vanilla NPCs now seamlessly dispense context-aware Cosmic Chronicles lore and ambient chatter.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What does this mod do?[/h2]
Avorion's background simulations are deep, but they often lack a voice. [b]Cosmic Chronicles[/b] translates the hard math dictating wars and economies into immersive human stories without causing server memory bloat. If you jump into a high War Heat sector, locals sound terrified. If an economy is booming, merchants boast about their wealth!

[b]⚠️ REQUIRED DEPENDENCIES:[/b]
This mod requires live data from the following mods to function:
1. [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3727542782]Cosmic Vault[/url]
2. [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3315794988]Cosmic Overhaul[/url]
3. [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3727544356]Cosmic War[/url]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Highlighted Features[/h2]
👉 [b][url=https://github.com/Stormiebox/Cosmic-Chronicles/wiki/Players-Guide-The-Living-Galaxy]Click here for the Player's Guide on the Wiki![/url][/b]

[list]
[*]🗣️ [b]The Rumormonger System:[/b] 60+ unique lines of interactive rumors, ambient chatter, and station-specific dialogue! Includes immersive tutorialization to learn mod mechanics naturally.
[*]🧑‍✈️ [b]Captain Synergies:[/b] Active captain class alters events! Scavengers extract better loot, Merchants negotiate hazard pay, and Smugglers safely extract rumors.
[*]📰 [b]Narrative Captain's Logs:[/b] Hooking directly into Cosmic Overhaul, captains append rich, narrative "Logs" to operation reports.
[*]🚀 [b]Refugee Convoys:[/b] In high War Heat sectors, fleeing civilian ships may appear. Donate resources to rescue them for massive reputation!
[*]🏚️ [b]Echoes of the Frontline:[/b] Discover massive, persistent derelict graveyards in empty sectors suffering from extreme conflict.
[*]📦 [b]Black Box Extraction:[/b] Hidden inside derelict graveyards are Stashes containing the final audio logs of doomed captains and dynamically scaling loot.
[*]🏛️ [b]Cinematic Cultural Monuments:[/b] Discover awe-inspiring procedural monuments in AI territory. Read their inscriptions for permanent +1500 reputation boosts!
[*]🛑 [b]Smart Anti-Spam:[/b] Ambient chatter operates on a global cooldown system so chat never floods.
[/list]

✅ [b]Fully Localized:[/b] Supported translations for Chinese, German, Russian, Portuguese, French, Japanese, and Spanish via Avorion's deferred translation engine.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]❓ FAQs & Compatibility[/h2]
[quote]
[b]Can I install this mid-playthrough?[/b]
[b]YES![/b] [i]Cosmic War[/i] will automatically scan your save and generate the required faction data so the Rumormonger immediately has plenty to talk about!

[b]Can I remove this mod mid-game?[/b]
[b]NO.[/b] It alters save games by attaching scripts (Rumormonger, Captain's Logs) to entities. Removing the mod will result in a flooded error log and corrupted save state.
[/quote]

[b]⚠️ INCOMPATIBILITIES:[/b]
[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2923179923]Xavorion: eXtended Avorion[/url] - Completely overrides the game's core fundamentals and is 100% incompatible.

